      "writtenOn": "2024-05-15T11:07:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "// This method does not need to modify mBlockedStatusTrackingUids because:\n    // - |nris| only contains per-app network requests created by ConnectivityService which\n    //   have no messenger and are not associated with any callbacks, and so do not need to be\n    //   tracked in mBlockedStatusTrackingUids.\n    // - The requests in perAppCallbackRequestsToUpdate are removed, modified, and re-added,\n    //   but the same number of requests is removed and re-added, and none of the requests\n    //   changes UID, so the number of requests for that UID before and after this method\n    //   remains the same. Re-adding the requests does not modify mBlockedStatusTrackingUids\n    //   (that is done when the app registers the request), so removing them must not\n    //   modify mBlockedStatusTrackingUids either.\n\n\nAfter this CL, it might be better to change this code so that instead of removing requests and re-adding them, modify them in place. This can be done by:\n- Registering the new requests in |nris| separately from the existing requests\n  which are currently returned by getPerAppCallbackRequestsToUpdate().\n- Instead of having getPerAppCallbackRequestsToUpdate return a list of NRIs to\n  update, rename it to updatePerAppCallbackRequests (or similar) and have it\n  scan the requests, and for each one replace it with the result of calling \n  createPerAppCallbackRequestsToRegister on that request.\n  - TODO: check what to do about the UID rule changes in handleRemoveNetworkRequest.\n    Maybe nothing, because if the rematch doesn\u0027t change the app\u0027s default, then no\n    changes need to be made, and if the rematch does change the app\u0027s default, then\n    makeDefaultForApps will take care of it?\n  - TODO: check what to do about the offer changes in handleRemoveNetworkRequest.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 13367,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 13370,
        "endChar": 63
      },
      "revId": "e0c521af944fcdf09c59564e1d68d28b33659fb2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
